Wrong (A): The treasury stock analogy in ASC 260 is limited to the consolidated group. Equity-method investees operate outside that boundary.
Wrong (B): The exclusion is not triggered by any affiliated entity holding shares. It requires consolidation, not merely an equity-method relationship.
